# Redirect Lightning's "pay 5 life" (CR 119.4): a player may pay life only up to their life total. Bot2, at 4 life with
# a single Mox Ruby, can pay neither "5 life" nor {R}{2}, so the cast is refused for the cost (`Mana: short`: it would be
# offered with mana for {2}); the Bolt resolves and Bot2 is at 1.

[Life]
Bot2: 4

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Redirect Lightning
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
! Bot2.Hand.Redirect Lightning.Cast(Stack.Lightning Bolt; Mana: short)
Bot2.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

